## pg_dump output -- data snapshots, not source, and can carry real
## farmer/insurance data (e.g. the local-to-remote-server migration dump).
*.dump
USTP CAPSTONE-20261008T140025Z-1-001/

## Google Cloud / Earth Engine service-account keys. These hold a live private
## key for a real GCP service account (e.g. webgis-pcic-*.json for
## agrisure-ee@webgis-pcic.iam.gserviceaccount.com) -- a credential, never
## source. Committing one publishes it to GitHub permanently, so it is matched
## by filename pattern here rather than relying on remembering to stage by path.
webgis-pcic-*.json
*-service-account*.json
*serviceaccount*.json
gcp-credentials*.json